<title>NETHERLANDS: BANGERT UPGRADES UNILEVER TO A BUY.</title>
<headline>BANGERT UPGRADES UNILEVER TO A BUY.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of May research note</p>
<p>Company------Sector-----------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Unilever     food-detergents  379.50  Bank Bangert Pontier</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (from Hold)</p>
<p>EPS estimates raised, based on ongoing strong sales and profit performance in Asia/Pacific and on underlying margin improvement in Europe. Benefits from restructuring and product mix improvement beginning to show. Recent $8 billion sale of speciality chemicals unit to ICI is very good deal and clear sign Unilever adopted more innovative and aggressive strategy, providing opportunity to focus on core strengths.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS   P/E    P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     15.00		 20.4   23.0   6.98</p>
<p>    1997		  17.20   16.80     22.2   24.9   7.90</p>
<p>    1998		  19.10   18.80     20.0   26.7   8.70</p>
<p>    1999		  21.00   20.70     18.2   28.4   9.40</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
